{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52308","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十九 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向（郭、项校「伺」）命取人鬼，[屠]（暑）儿杀羊客。\n鬼识人兴料，客辨羊肉厄。\n人自不觉死，羊亦不觉搦。\n恰似园中瓜，合熟即须擿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}